# Same bytes on every system: text files are stored and checked out with LF, except the Windows launcher, which
# cmd.exe reads best with CRLF. build_release.py takes files through these rules, so the release zip is identical
# whether it is built on Windows or Linux.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.zip binary
*.ba2 binary
*.esm binary
*.esp binary
*.esl binary
